<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-FRENCH LEAGUE CUP SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FRENCH LEAGUE CUP SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of French League Cup</p>
<p>semifinals played on Tuesday:</p>
<p> Bordeaux    2  Montpellier   2 - after extra time</p>
<p>(90 mins 1-1. Bordeaux won 7-6 on penalties)</p>
<p> Strasbourg  v  Monaco	  kickoff 1915 GMT</p>
